.TH MAN-PAGES-POSIX 7 "2026-11-20" "FenrirOS" "Miscellaneous Information Manual"
.SH NAME
man-pages-posix \- which POSIX edition the 0p, 1p and 3p manual pages describe
.SH DESCRIPTION
The pages in sections 0p (headers), 1p (utilities) and 3p (functions) are from the
Linux man-pages-posix project, release 2017-a. They describe
.B IEEE Std 1003.1-2017
(POSIX.1-2017, the Single UNIX Specification version 4, 2018 edition).
.PP
They are
.B not
the current standard. POSIX.1-2024 (IEEE Std 1003.1-2024, "Issue 8") changed and added things
that these pages do not show, for example the shell option
.BR "set -o pipefail" ,
and changes to several utilities and functions. When a page here and the 2024 text disagree,
the 2024 text is the standard.
.PP
No manual pages for the 2024 edition are shipped. The man-pages-posix project has not published
a release after 2017-a, and the terms under which the Open Group allows its text to be
redistributed have not been checked for a conversion of the 2024 edition. The standard itself
can be read at
.IR https://pubs.opengroup.org/onlinepubs/9799919799/ .
.SH SEE ALSO
.BR man (1)
